{"4863150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pool Cats", "steam_appid": 4863150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pool Cats is a realistic first-person pool simulator. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the table, line up your shot, control the cue, and run the rack your way. Play solo, host online in a pool hall with friends, or play against challenging NPCs and puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL POOL FEEL. FIRST-PERSON PRESENCE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool Cats is built around the feeling most pool games miss: actually being at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk the shot. Read the angle. Control your cue and choose your power. Every rack is a mix of strategy and execution, just like real pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/380e3c4f7d4677c0088a75e1155b2ddc.poster.avif?t=1788281831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/380e3c4f7d4677c0088a75e1155b2ddc.webm?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/380e3c4f7d4677c0088a75e1155b2ddc.mp4?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC, DATA-TUNED PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I tuned Pool Cats physics by collecting slow-motion video data of ball trajectories on my 8' Diamond table. This will be the best pool experience you have played virtually. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool Cats simulator goes above and beyond to model various physics nuance that need to be right like complete 3D cushion response profiles, cushion compression, masse shots and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/63199da21b5e600c2a276bfc8e35f08f.poster.avif?t=1788281831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/63199da21b5e600c2a276bfc8e35f08f.webm?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/63199da21b5e600c2a276bfc8e35f08f.mp4?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY POOL ONLINE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a public or private clubhouse for up to eight players. Invite friends, play online, find a match with strangers, or take on a lineup of challenging NPC opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/26306998cdad6a57d846e6690aeb5308.poster.avif?t=1788281831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/26306998cdad6a57d846e6690aeb5308.webm?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/26306998cdad6a57d846e6690aeb5308.mp4?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER POOL CHALLENGES &amp; TRICK SHOTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool Cats features a challenge designer where players can publish and play trick shots designed by the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AVAILABLE AT LAUNCH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard modes: 8-ball, 9-ball, 10-ball, and 14.1 Continuous (Straight Pool)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting new mode: Daily Rack. Play a seeded 9-ball rack and complete on the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge designer with Steam Workshop integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and private pool halls for up to eight players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online play, friends, bots, and challenging NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/bdbd8ff3a249de51393fc5d4bc922f33.poster.avif?t=1788281831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/bdbd8ff3a249de51393fc5d4bc922f33.webm?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/bdbd8ff3a249de51393fc5d4bc922f33.mp4?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Immersive first-person pool controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pool Cats is a realistic first-person pool simulator. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the table, line up your shot, control the cue, and run the rack your way. Play solo, host online in a pool hall with friends, or play against challenging NPCs and puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL POOL FEEL. FIRST-PERSON PRESENCE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool Cats is built around the feeling most pool games miss: actually being at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk the shot. Read the angle. Control your cue and choose your power. Every rack is a mix of strategy and execution, just like real pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/380e3c4f7d4677c0088a75e1155b2ddc.poster.avif?t=1788281831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/380e3c4f7d4677c0088a75e1155b2ddc.webm?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/380e3c4f7d4677c0088a75e1155b2ddc.mp4?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC, DATA-TUNED PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I tuned Pool Cats physics by collecting slow-motion video data of ball trajectories on my 8' Diamond table. This will be the best pool experience you have played virtually. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool Cats simulator goes above and beyond to model various physics nuance that need to be right like complete 3D cushion response profiles, cushion compression, masse shots and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/63199da21b5e600c2a276bfc8e35f08f.poster.avif?t=1788281831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/63199da21b5e600c2a276bfc8e35f08f.webm?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4863150/extras/63199da21b5e600c2a276bfc8e35f08f.mp4?t=1788281831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY POOL ONLINE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a public or private clubhouse for up to eight players. Invite friends, play online, find a match with strangers, or take on a lineup of challenging NPC opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli